  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smart &amp; Sustainable Aviation Program Indonesia (PTM23ID01)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to organise a study visit (incoming mission) consisting of workshops and site visits for Indonesian aviation stakeholders. The main purpose of the study visit is to strengthen the Indonesian ecosystem with regard to the application of smart &amp; sustainable aviation, and on the other side to showcase Dutch aviation expertise. This project will also strengthen the relationship between Dutch-Indonesian aviation relations (about 10 Dutch companies are exploring commercial collaboration opportunities in Indonesia).</narrative>
  </description>
